<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-align-dwc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Formal OWL and SKOS alignment declarations between Iroko Ewe Module terms and Darwin Core (dwc:) terms published by TDWG. This file is reference-only infrastructure: it contains no user-facing vocabulary terms. Import or cite alongside iroko-ewe when interoperating with herbarium, occurrence, and biodiversity informatics systems."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-align-dwc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://dwc.tdwg.org/terms/> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-align-dwc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-framework/> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/associatedMedia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Iroko Framework context: closeMatch to iroko:photographicVoucher. Range difference: iroko:DocumentaryEvidence vs. free-text URI list."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-align-dwc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-03-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-align-dwc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Iroko Framework: Darwin Core Alignment"@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/Occurrence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Iroko Framework context: equivalent to iroko:Plant. See iroko-align-dwc."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-align-dwc> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-ewe> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#photographicVoucher> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/associatedMedia> .
